        "char_start": 142,
        "char_end": 299,
        "line_start": 5,
        "line_end": 5,
        "text": "Provider Cedar's fictional realized price fell -40% to $0.90 per million tokens. Provider Birch's price was $0.50. Model mix and token types are unspecified.",
